{"version": 2, "width": 92, "height": 30, "timestamp": 1789456343, "title": "readset demo"}
[0.0, "o", "$ readset demo\r\n"]
[0.6, "o", "\u001b[1mreadset demo: two agents, one file, no locks\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.88, "o", "\r\n"]
[1.16, "o", "\u001b[36m1. agent-a reads billing.py\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.44, "o", "\u001b[36m2. agent-b reads billing.py\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.72, "o", "\u001b[36m3. agent-b changes the tax rate and writes\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[2.0, "o", "\u001b[36m4. agent-a, still holding its old view, tries to write its refactor\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[2.28, "o", "\r\n"]
[2.56, "o", "   readset: write to billing.py blocked - the file changed after you read it.\r\n"]
[2.84, "o", "   \r\n"]
[3.12, "o", "   Changed by: agent-b (Fix)\r\n"]
[3.4, "o", "   \r\n"]
[3.68, "o", "   --- billing.py (what you read)\r\n"]
[3.96, "o", "   +++ billing.py (on disk now)\r\n"]
[4.24, "o", "   @@ -1,4 +1,4 @@\r\n"]
[4.52, "o", "\u001b[31m   -TAX_RATE = 0.18\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[4.8, "o", "\u001b[32m   +TAX_RATE = 0.20\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[5.08, "o", "    \r\n"]
[5.36, "o", "    \r\n"]
[5.64, "o", "    def total(net):\r\n"]
[5.92, "o", "   \r\n"]
[6.2, "o", "   What to do: Read billing.py again, then retry your edit against the current content.\r\n"]
[7.88, "o", "\r\n"]
[8.16, "o", "\u001b[36m5. agent-a re-reads billing.py and retries against the current content\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[8.44, "o", "\u001b[32m   write succeeded; both changes are in the file\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[8.72, "o", "\r\n"]
[9.0, "o", "\u001b[2mWithout readset, step 4 would have silently discarded agent-b's fix.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
